====== COMFAST CF-E130N v2======

{{:media:comfast:cfe130nr.jpg?180|CF-E130N right view (image from comfast.com.cn)}}

The [[http://en.comfast.com.cn/index.php?m=content&c=index&a=show&catid=19&id=39|COMFAST CF-E130N]] is an outdoor 2.4 GHz wireless CPE. It is based on the [[docs:techref:hardware:soc:soc.qualcomm.ar71xx|Qualcomm Atheros QCA9531/9533]] SoC, and features one RJ45 10/100 Mbps Ethernet port with PoE in and a 300 Mbps 2.4 GHz 802.11b/g/n radio connected to an internal 5 dBi atenna.


